cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ORCHID-SAGE, please cite the paper and this software."
title: "ORCHID-SAGE: Systematic Assessment of Gibbs Energies"
abstract: >-
  A standard, tools and an MCP server for fully reproducible CALPHAD assessments: general and specific protocols,
  their schema and validator, a reproduction tool that reruns a protocol and compares the result within declared
  tolerances, and the Cr-Ni assessment that accompanies the paper.
